<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!--
  Deity pantheons (D042 amendment). The builder's Deity table groups
  deities into collapsible bands by their authored "Pantheon" specific;
  stock deities are grouped by setting, from each record's first source:
  Core (Player's Handbook and Dungeon Master's Guide, so Corellon's
  "Player's Handbook,Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide" is Core), Forgotten
  Realms (Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide, including the "(Forgotten
  Realms)" duplicates), Eberron (Eberron Player's Guide) and Dragon Magazine
  (Dragon Magazine 390 and 427). Pantheon is a modern specific the old
  builder ignores. Generated from the pack by a
  script in ignored tmp/deity-pantheon/; merged after the CBLoader parts by
  scripts/build-private-content.sh. Structure only; no official text.
-->
<D20Rules game-system="D&amp;D4E">

